{
  "_id": "fhSubStmPatch001",
  "name": "Spaceport Stim-Patch",
  "type": "consumable",
  "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
  "folder": "fhSubSciFi000001",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A single-use transdermal patch favored by dock crews working triple shifts. The active blend kicks in within seconds; the comedown is shorter and meaner than the high. Heavy users say everything sounds a little muffled. Approved for spaceport use only on paper; in practice it follows the freight.</p><p><strong><em>Desired effects on use.</em></strong> For 30 minutes you are wide awake: you have advantage on Constitution checks and a +2 bonus to Constitution saving throws.</p><p><strong><em>On use, save against addiction.</em></strong> Make a DC 12 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, you gain the Addicted condition from Spaceport Stim-Patch (see below).</p><p><strong><em>Addicted from Spaceport Stim-Patch.</em></strong> While you have this Addicted condition, you are also Poisoned and have disadvantage on Wisdom (Perception) checks (a faint ringing in your ears).</p><p><strong><em>Withdrawal.</em></strong> At the end of each Long Rest while addicted, you either take another dose or abstain. If you abstain, make a DC 11 Wisdom check to resist the craving; on a failure, you give in and take a dose. On a success, you go into withdrawal for 1 day, or half that if you succeed on a DC 12 Constitution saving throw. If you have no doses left, skip the Wisdom check. While in withdrawal you take a -2 penalty to all ability checks and saving throws and have disadvantage on initiative rolls. Abstaining then takes only the Wisdom check, and taking any dose ends the withdrawal but not the addiction. When the withdrawal ends, so does the addiction.</p><p><strong><em>Overdose.</em></strong> If you take a dose while still under its effects, or once your tolerance is at its limit, there is a 15% chance you overdose: you take 2d6 poison damage and have the Poisoned condition for 1 minute.</p><p><strong><em>Dosing others.</em></strong> As an action, you can make a melee attack to slap a patch on a creature within 5 feet. On a hit, the creature is dosed.</p><p><em>Requires ready paraphernalia that applies to contact substances, such as a Neural Diffuser.</em></p>"
    },
